{"real": true, "dur": 113.67, "sent": [{"start": 0.24, "end": 4.8, "text": "Now, you might be thinking: so learners never come across anything new?", "words": [{"w": "Now,", "s": 0.24}, {"w": "you", "s": 0.92}, {"w": "might", "s": 1.02}, {"w": "be", "s": 1.18}, {"w": "thinking:", "s": 1.34}, {"w": "so", "s": 2.4}, {"w": "learners", "s": 2.64}, {"w": "never", "s": 3.06}, {"w": "come", "s": 3.38}, {"w": "across", "s": 3.58}, {"w": "anything", "s": 4.14}, {"w": "new?", "s": 4.6}]}, {"start": 5.42, "end": 6.62, "text": "In fact, they do.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 5.42}, {"w": "fact,", "s": 5.64}, {"w": "they", "s": 6.16}, {"w": "do.", "s": 6.38}]}, {"start": 7.38, "end": 10.82, "text": "That’s because the French approach I follow is a spiral.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 7.38}, {"w": "because", "s": 7.62}, {"w": "the", "s": 8.48}, {"w": "French", "s": 8.66}, {"w": "approach", "s": 8.98}, {"w": "I", "s": 9.54}, {"w": "follow", "s": 9.68}, {"w": "is", "s": 10.1}, {"w": "a", "s": 10.26}, {"w": "spiral.", "s": 10.44}]}, {"start": 11.26, "end": 18.62, "text": "In a spiral, learners meet things early, as whole phrases, and figure out how they work later.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 11.26}, {"w": "a", "s": 11.36}, {"w": "spiral,", "s": 11.52}, {"w": "learners", "s": 12.4}, {"w": "meet", "s": 12.86}, {"w": "things", "s": 13.1}, {"w": "early,", "s": 13.6}, {"w": "as", "s": 14.66}, {"w": "whole", "s": 14.88}, {"w": "phrases,", "s": 15.14}, {"w": "and", "s": 16.44}, {"w": "figure", "s": 16.66}, {"w": "out", "s": 17.0}, {"w": "how", "s": 17.28}, {"w": "they", "s": 17.52}, {"w": "work", "s": 17.74}, {"w": "later.", "s": 18.2}]}, {"start": 19.5, "end": 23.6, "text": "So I’ve divided what learners encounter into three categories.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 19.5}, {"w": "I’ve", "s": 20.1}, {"w": "divided", "s": 20.32}, {"w": "what", "s": 20.86}, {"w": "learners", "s": 21.06}, {"w": "encounter", "s": 21.46}, {"w": "into", "s": 22.18}, {"w": "three", "s": 22.58}, {"w": "categories.", "s": 22.92}]}, {"start": 24.04, "end": 30.94, "text": "Seen means learners come across a phrase, but they don’t have to study it or get tested on it.", "words": [{"w": "Seen", "s": 24.04}, {"w": "means", "s": 24.82}, {"w": "learners", "s": 25.56}, {"w": "come", "s": 26.14}, {"w": "across", "s": 26.32}, {"w": "a", "s": 26.78}, {"w": "phrase,", "s": 26.88}, {"w": "but", "s": 27.88}, {"w": "they", "s": 28.08}, {"w": "don’t", "s": 28.38}, {"w": "have", "s": 28.66}, {"w": "to", "s": 28.88}, {"w": "study", "s": 29.08}, {"w": "it", "s": 29.42}, {"w": "or", "s": 29.72}, {"w": "get", "s": 29.88}, {"w": "tested", "s": 30.16}, {"w": "on", "s": 30.64}, {"w": "it.", "s": 30.8}]}, {"start": 31.58, "end": 37.82, "text": "Then, Focus means it’s time to learn it properly, with explanations and practice.", "words": [{"w": "Then,", "s": 31.58}, {"w": "Focus", "s": 32.299}, {"w": "means", "s": 33.16}, {"w": "it’s", "s": 33.66}, {"w": "time", "s": 33.92}, {"w": "to", "s": 34.22}, {"w": "learn", "s": 34.38}, {"w": "it", "s": 34.56}, {"w": "properly,", "s": 34.72}, {"w": "with", "s": 35.8}, {"w": "explanations", "s": 36.08}, {"w": "and", "s": 37.08}, {"w": "practice.", "s": 37.3}]}, {"start": 38.32, "end": 45.3, "text": "And finally, Scored means learners can now be tested on it, but only once the course has taught it.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 38.32}, {"w": "finally,", "s": 38.58}, {"w": "Scored", "s": 39.9}, {"w": "means", "s": 40.32}, {"w": "learners", "s": 41.18}, {"w": "can", "s": 41.56}, {"w": "now", "s": 41.74}, {"w": "be", "s": 41.94}, {"w": "tested", "s": 42.12}, {"w": "on", "s": 42.58}, {"w": "it,", "s": 42.74}, {"w": "but", "s": 43.44}, {"w": "only", "s": 43.66}, {"w": "once", "s": 43.98}, {"w": "the", "s": 44.2}, {"w": "course", "s": 44.36}, {"w": "has", "s": 44.64}, {"w": "taught", "s": 44.88}, {"w": "it.", "s": 45.12}]}, {"start": 46.12, "end": 48.26, "text": "To picture it, think of a camera.", "words": [{"w": "To", "s": 46.12}, {"w": "picture", "s": 46.28}, {"w": "it,", "s": 46.66}, {"w": "think", "s": 47.34}, {"w": "of", "s": 47.6}, {"w": "a", "s": 47.72}, {"w": "camera.", "s": 47.84}]}, {"start": 48.9, "end": 50.96, "text": "Something can be in the shot but blurry.", "words": [{"w": "Something", "s": 48.9}, {"w": "can", "s": 49.26}, {"w": "be", "s": 49.44}, {"w": "in", "s": 49.58}, {"w": "the", "s": 49.68}, {"w": "shot", "s": 49.84}, {"w": "but", "s": 50.3}, {"w": "blurry.", "s": 50.54}]}, {"start": 51.74, "end": 52.42, "text": "That’s Seen.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 51.74}, {"w": "Seen.", "s": 52.08}]}, {"start": 52.76, "end": 54.5, "text": "Then you bring it into focus.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "s": 52.76}, {"w": "you", "s": 52.96}, {"w": "bring", "s": 53.12}, {"w": "it", "s": 53.34}, {"w": "into", "s": 53.58}, {"w": "focus.", "s": 53.98}]}, {"start": 54.92, "end": 55.7, "text": "That’s Focus.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 54.92}, {"w": "Focus.", "s": 55.24}]}, {"start": 56.18, "end": 58.02, "text": "And only then do you take the picture.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 56.18}, {"w": "only", "s": 56.42}, {"w": "then", "s": 56.74}, {"w": "do", "s": 57.04}, {"w": "you", "s": 57.18}, {"w": "take", "s": 57.34}, {"w": "the", "s": 57.52}, {"w": "picture.", "s": 57.66}]}, {"start": 58.54, "end": 59.28, "text": "That’s Scored.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 58.54}, {"w": "Scored.", "s": 58.88}]}, {"start": 59.92, "end": 69.04, "text": "In practice, learners meet “I was born in” before studying the past tense, and “How are you?” before learning the verb “to go.”", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 59.92}, {"w": "practice,", "s": 60.08}, {"w": "learners", "s": 61.16}, {"w": "meet", "s": 61.6}, {"w": "“I", "s": 61.8}, {"w": "was", "s": 62.34}, {"w": "born", "s": 62.62}, {"w": "in”", "s": 62.96}, {"w": "before", "s": 63.46}, {"w": "studying", "s": 63.9}, {"w": "the", "s": 64.42}, {"w": "past", "s": 64.56}, {"w": "tense,", "s": 64.9}, {"w": "and", "s": 65.82}, {"w": "“How", "s": 65.94}, {"w": "are", "s": 66.34}, {"w": "you?”", "s": 66.56}, {"w": "before", "s": 67.22}, {"w": "learning", "s": 67.58}, {"w": "the", "s": 67.86}, {"w": "verb", "s": 68.02}, {"w": "“to", "s": 68.26}, {"w": "go.”", "s": 68.82}]}, {"start": 69.48, "end": 74.88, "text": "On top of that, I also allow a little unfamiliar language, roughly twenty percent.", "words": [{"w": "On", "s": 69.48}, {"w": "top", "s": 69.62}, {"w": "of", "s": 69.82}, {"w": "that,", "s": 70.0}, {"w": "I", "s": 70.68}, {"w": "also", "s": 70.84}, {"w": "allow", "s": 71.22}, {"w": "a", "s": 71.68}, {"w": "little", "s": 71.8}, {"w": "unfamiliar", "s": 72.14}, {"w": "language,", "s": 72.8}, {"w": "roughly", "s": 73.66}, {"w": "twenty", "s": 74.14}, {"w": "percent.", "s": 74.48}]}, {"start": 75.48, "end": 78.32, "text": "That’s because people learn by struggling a bit.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 75.48}, {"w": "because", "s": 75.68}, {"w": "people", "s": 76.5}, {"w": "learn", "s": 76.88}, {"w": "by", "s": 77.16}, {"w": "struggling", "s": 77.42}, {"w": "a", "s": 77.96}, {"w": "bit.", "s": 78.08}]}, {"start": 78.78, "end": 81.52, "text": "If everything’s familiar, it’s too easy.", "words": [{"w": "If", "s": 78.78}, {"w": "everything’s", "s": 79.04}, {"w": "familiar,", "s": 79.6}, {"w": "it’s", "s": 80.7}, {"w": "too", "s": 80.9}, {"w": "easy.", "s": 81.16}]}, {"start": 82.4, "end": 85.06, "text": "If half of it is unknown, it’s too hard.", "words": [{"w": "If", "s": 82.4}, {"w": "half", "s": 82.56}, {"w": "of", "s": 82.84}, {"w": "it", "s": 83.0}, {"w": "is", "s": 83.2}, {"w": "unknown,", "s": 83.4}, {"w": "it’s", "s": 84.3}, {"w": "too", "s": 84.54}, {"w": "hard.", "s": 84.76}]}, {"start": 85.86, "end": 90.62, "text": "But learners should never need that unfamiliar language to get the answer right.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 85.86}, {"w": "learners", "s": 86.08}, {"w": "should", "s": 86.48}, {"w": "never", "s": 86.74}, {"w": "need", "s": 87.14}, {"w": "that", "s": 87.46}, {"w": "unfamiliar", "s": 87.78}, {"w": "language", "s": 88.48}, {"w": "to", "s": 89.34}, {"w": "get", "s": 89.5}, {"w": "the", "s": 89.72}, {"w": "answer", "s": 89.9}, {"w": "right.", "s": 90.32}]}, {"start": 91.0, "end": 102.8, "text": "To see the difference, look at the first sentence: “At weekends, I go … skiing.” The answer is the word for “some,” so it doesn’t matter that “weekend” is new.", "words": [{"w": "To", "s": 91.0}, {"w": "see", "s": 91.18}, {"w": "the", "s": 91.36}, {"w": "difference,", "s": 91.48}, {"w": "look", "s": 92.48}, {"w": "at", "s": 92.68}, {"w": "the", "s": 92.82}, {"w": "first", "s": 92.98}, {"w": "sentence:", "s": 93.22}, {"w": "“At", "s": 93.76}, {"w": "weekends,", "s": 94.46}, {"w": "I", "s": 95.34}, {"w": "go", "s": 95.52}, {"w": "…", "s": 95.72}, {"w": "skiing.”", "s": 96.44}, {"w": "The", "s": 97.7}, {"w": "answer", "s": 97.88}, {"w": "is", "s": 98.32}, {"w": "the", "s": 98.44}, {"w": "word", "s": 98.58}, {"w": "for", "s": 98.86}, {"w": "“some,”", "s": 99.06}, {"w": "so", "s": 100.44}, {"w": "it", "s": 100.66}, {"w": "doesn’t", "s": 100.78}, {"w": "matter", "s": 101.1}, {"w": "that", "s": 101.48}, {"w": "“weekend”", "s": 101.58}, {"w": "is", "s": 102.38}, {"w": "new.", "s": 102.56}]}, {"start": 103.24, "end": 111.38, "text": "Now the second one says “It is two …” This time, the answer would be “half past,” which is never taught.", "words": [{"w": "Now", "s": 103.24}, {"w": "the", "s": 103.42}, {"w": "second", "s": 103.56}, {"w": "one", "s": 103.84}, {"w": "says", "s": 104.06}, {"w": "“It", "s": 104.38}, {"w": "is", "s": 104.94}, {"w": "two", "s": 105.3}, {"w": "…”", "s": 105.56}, {"w": "This", "s": 106.58}, {"w": "time,", "s": 106.82}, {"w": "the", "s": 107.54}, {"w": "answer", "s": 107.74}, {"w": "would", "s": 108.12}, {"w": "be", "s": 108.32}, {"w": "“half", "s": 108.46}, {"w": "past,”", "s": 109.24}, {"w": "which", "s": 110.4}, {"w": "is", "s": 110.58}, {"w": "never", "s": 110.78}, {"w": "taught.", "s": 111.06}]}, {"start": 111.94, "end": 112.9, "text": "So that one’s out.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 111.94}, {"w": "that", "s": 112.12}, {"w": "one’s", "s": 112.3}, {"w": "out.", "s": 112.64}]}]}